@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@using Shopfolio.Pages.Lists
@model IReadOnlyList<ProductCard>
@* The product grid (04 2.11.5, 2.13.5; T545): two columns on the narrow class, three on the medium, four on the wide (the style sheet). The category page, the search result, the related products
   and the home page's showcase all draw their cards through this one grid and the one card. The order is the list's: there is no sort control (04 2.13.1). *@
<ul class="card-grid">
    @foreach (var card in Model)
    {
        <li class="card-grid__item">
            <partial name="_ProductCard" model="card" />
        </li>
    }
</ul>
